{"3684010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "3 Hell", "steam_appid": 3684010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684010/extras/2b6dbc0f99d33d1f0fd574f66a3b8502.poster.avif?t=1763253806\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684010/extras/2b6dbc0f99d33d1f0fd574f66a3b8502.webm?t=1763253806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Hell </strong>is a fast-paced arena action game inspired by classic hack-and-slash and survival mechanics. Dive into a brutal arena full of relentless enemies, where every move matters. Armed only with your blade and magical powers, you must overcome tight spaces and face waves of opponents who will stop at nothing to destroy you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your abilities come at a cost, and there’s no room for mistakes. Use quick reflexes, precise strikes, and calculated aggression to survive—as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with friends on global leaderboards. Only those with true skill and iron nerves will endure. Your ability to balance risk and power will be tested to the limit.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684010/extras/2b6dbc0f99d33d1f0fd574f66a3b8502.poster.avif?t=1763253806\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684010/extras/2b6dbc0f99d33d1f0fd574f66a3b8502.webm?t=1763253806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Hell </strong>is a fast-paced arena action game inspired by classic hack-and-slash and survival mechanics. Dive into a brutal arena full of relentless enemies, where every move matters. Armed only with your blade and magical powers, you must overcome tight spaces and face waves of opponents who will stop at nothing to destroy you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your abilities come at a cost, and there’s no room for mistakes. Use quick reflexes, precise strikes, and calculated aggression to survive—as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with friends on global leaderboards. Only those with true skill and iron nerves will endure. Your ability to balance risk and power will be tested to the limit.</p>", "short_description": "3 Hell is a close-combat arena game where aggression is the only survival strategy.The arena doesn’t wait. Enemies don’t hesitate.Power comes at a price — and time is never on your side.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684010/ece53c3436667d7e3cfccbaba645261ea4c6dc5d/header.jpg?t=1763253806", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684010/6c06b530e845411e306ab9dc064b3b53178ce4e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763253806", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684010/6c06b530e845411e306ab9dc064b3b53178ce4e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763253806", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 770<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Bekvi"], "publishers": ["Tsh"], "price_ov